2026-10-04T18:58:16.4149792Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4254959Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4264463Z [0m
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4265102Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4265876Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4266257Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4266757Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4267887Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4268405Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4268689Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4269362Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4269694Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4270274Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4271710Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4272256Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4272654Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4272852Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4273043Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4273627Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4273982Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4274510Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4274671Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4274792Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4274978Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4275309Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4275814Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4280096Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4280273Z I will:
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4280563Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4281064Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4281634Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4282069Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4282513Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4282826Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4283133Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4283591Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4284221Z    /root
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4295531Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4296363Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4307346Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4308132Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4308439Z 
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4309344Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-04T18:58:16.4309927Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
